n wij worden ziek en wij sterven.","eind":"،"},{"woorden":[{"w":"فَكَيْفَ","ids":["fa","kayfa"]},{"w":"نَعْبُدُ","ids":["abad"]},{"w":"اللَّهَ","ids":["allah"]},{"w":"وَنَذْكُرُهُ","ids":["wa","dhakar","_hu"]},{"w":"دَائِماً","ids":["daim"]}],"nl":"Hoe zouden wij dan Allah aanbidden en Hem altijd gedenken?","eind":"؟"},{"woorden":[{"w":"وَإِذَا","ids":["wa","idha"]},{"w":"كَانَ","ids":["kan"]},{"w":"الرَّسُوْلُ","ids":["al","rasul"]},{"w":"بَشَراً","ids":["bashar"]},{"w":"قَالَ","ids":["qal"]},{"w":"أَنَا","ids":["ana"]},{"w":"مِثْلُكُمْ","ids":["mithl","_kum"]},{"w":"أَعْطَشُ","ids":["atish"]},{"w":"وَأَجُوْعُ","ids":["wa","jaa"]},{"w":"وَأَمْرَضُ","ids":["wa","marid_v"]},{"w":"وَأَمُوْتُ","ids":["wa","mat"]},{"w":"وَأَعْبُدُ","ids":["wa","abad"]},{"w":"اللَّهَ","ids":["allah"]},{"w":"وَأَذْكُرُهُ","ids":["wa","dhakar","_hu"]}],"nl":"En als de boodschapper een mens is, zegt hij: ik ben zoals jullie — ik krijg dorst en honger, ik word ziek en ik sterf, en ik aanbid Allah en gedenk Hem.","eind":"،"},{"woorden":[{"w":"فَلِمَاذَا","ids":["fa","limadha"]},{"w":"لا","ids":["la"]},{"w":"تَعْبُدُوْنَ","ids":["abad"]},{"w":"اللَّهَ","ids":["allah"]},{"w":"وَلَا","ids":["wa","la"]},{"w":"تَذْكُرُونَهُ","ids":["dhakar","_hu"]}],"nl":"Waarom aanbidden jullie Allah dan niet en gedenken jullie Hem niet?","eind":"؟"},{"woorden":[{"w":"فَيَنْقَطِعُ","ids":["fa","inqata"]},{"w":"كَلامُ","ids":["kalam"]},{"w":"النَّاسِ","ids":["al","nas"]},{"w":"وَلا","ids":["wa","la"]},{"w":"يَجِدُوْنَ","ids":["wajad"]},{"w":"عُذْراً","ids":["udhr"]}],"nl":"En dan houdt het gepraat van de mensen op en vinden zij geen verontschuldiging.","eind":"."}],"lijst":{"ism":["_hu","_ka","_kum","_na","ahl","allah","ana","bashar","daim","dhurriya","hadha","huwa","idha","kalam","kayfa","limadha","maa","malak","mithl","nahnu","nas","rasul","tadhkirah","udhr","wahid"],"fil":["abad","akal","arad","araf","atish","dhakar","fahim","inqata","jaa","kan","marid_v","mat","qal","sharib","wajad","walla"],"harf":["al","fa",